      "translation": {
        "english_text": "The ruler of Kurinji country had two wives. Both were pregnant. Durjayan, the elder brother of the younger queen, had one particular desire: to preserve his power, his sister's child should rule the land. Because of that.................",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "`தரணி` is rendered as `the land` in the dynastic-rule context; the source ellipsis is preserved."
        ]
      }
    },
