      "translation": {
        "english_text": "There is no one to plead for me. Singari has her brother on her side. And she has the king, who is dear to her. Truth alone is my witness!",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "The source phrase `அவள், அன்புக்குரிய மன்னர்` is syntactically compressed; the English stays conservative and does not infer a relationship beyond the printed wording."
