      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Kalinga, the matter has gone wrong. What we expected did not happen. Tomorrow in court our plots will be exposed. A grave will be built for this Durjayan's absolute power. My desire that my sister's son should rule this land will be destroyed. If we are to recover from this, the Maharani must die.",
